From f1433965d1be3be670dc3d478544862cc9115651 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: simcc-repository <adrenfu@simcc.org>
Date: Fri, 15 May 2026 14:25:30 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(embedder): add OPENROUTER_BASE_URL override + LiteLLM
 compose wiring

Allows the openrouter embedder to be pointed at any OpenAI-compatible base URL
(default unchanged: https://openrouter.ai/api/v1). Used to route traffic through
our self-hosted LiteLLM gateway on 192.168.50.148:4000 for cost tracking in
Langfuse.

Also adjusts docker-compose.yml for our deployment:
- postgres internal-only (expose, not publish)
- api attached to external litellm-langfuse_default network

See PATCH_NOTES.md for the rationale and upstream-rebase workflow.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
